WEBVTT

00:00:02.699 --> 00:00:08.213
Meet Wattlebooks.
Free invoicing for sole traders, tradies and freelancers.

00:00:10.613 --> 00:00:15.670
Send a proper tax invoice in about a minute,
with the GST already worked out.

00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:21.620
Snap a receipt and it reads the amount for you,
so your spending's sorted too.

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:27.685
Come tax time, your BAS figures
and profit and loss are ready to go.

00:00:28.885 --> 00:00:36.554
It's set up for Australia, New Zealand, the UK,
Canada and the US, and bills clients anywhere.

00:00:38.054 --> 00:00:43.478
No monthly fee, no account,
and your books stay on your own computer.

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:48.379
Wattlebooks.
Free to download, and free to keep.
